$\Loss(\tensor{X}, \mat{r}) \le \SurrogateLoss(\tensor{X}, \mat{r})$
is a restatement of \Cref{lemma:upper_bound_for_loss}.
\end{proof}

\HosvdTruncationError*

\begin{proof}
The proof follows by combining~\Cref{lemma:upper_bound_for_loss}
and
Equation~\Cref{eqn:sum_modewise_tail_errors}.
