\begin{proof} \begin{proof}
  First, consider the case where at the end of \diststrm $|S|=|OPT|/\epsilon$.
  Then,
  \begin{align*}
    g(S)-c(S) &\overset{(a)}{\geq} g(S)-g(\emptyset)-\beta c(S)\\
    &\overset{(b)}{\geq} \sum_{i=1}^{|S|}\left(\Delta g(S_{i-1},s_i)-\beta c(s_i)\right)\\
    &\overset{(c)}{\geq} |S|\epsilon\tau/|OPT|\\
    &\overset{(d)}{=} \tau\\
